    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PetMate is a new table pet game designed to create a virtual companion that can actually interact with you. Unlike traditional desktop cartoon images, PetMate is not just a static virtual character, it can talk to you and has the ability to communicate visually, audibly and emotionally, as if it were a real friend. What's more, PetMate is able to memorize your memories and become your exclusive companion, adding a unique emotional connection with every interaction.</p>",
